Output docs/demo.gif
Output docs/demo.mp4

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1180
Set Height 700
Set Padding 26
Set Theme "TokyoNight"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "cd ~/Desktop/Projects/toolsmith/practice-repo && source ../venv/bin/activate && clear" Enter
Sleep 2s
Show

Type "pytest -q | tail -3" Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "braze --yes" Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "add a --json flag to the wc CLI so the failing tests pass, then run the tests" Enter
Sleep 24s

Type "why did you use edit_file instead of write_file" Enter
Sleep 14s

Type "/exit" Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "pytest -q | tail -3" Enter
Sleep 4s
